<title>USA: Bio Fluorescent ends merger talks.</title>
<headline>Bio Fluorescent ends merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>SCOTTSDALE, Ariz. 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio Fluorescent Technologies Inc on Tuesday said it has ceased merger negotiations with Canadian biotechnology company, INR.</p>
<p>INR believes under the policies of the Vancouver Stock Exchange, Bio Fluorescent would not be allowed to enter into a merger deal until one year after INR's amalgamation, which was completed less than 6 months ago.</p>
<p>In a statement, Bio Fluorescent said it will monitor INR's progress and track its technology.</p>
</text>
